our quarters to 2026-07-31 revenue added up to $59.2 billion (computed from five filed figures), operating income to $3.2 billion and net income to $2.5 billion.","cites":["HPQ.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPQ.d.revenue.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPQ.d.revenue.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPQ.d.revenue.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPQ.d.revenue.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","HPQ.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPQ.d.opinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPQ.d.opinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPQ.d.opinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPQ.d.opinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31","HPQ.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPQ.d.netinc.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPQ.d.netinc.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPQ.d.netinc.2026-02-01.2026-04-30","HPQ.d.netinc.2026-05-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"ttm","text":"Free cash flow over the same four quarters was $3.9 billion: operating cash flow of $4.7 billion less capital spending of $787 million (computed from ten filed figures).","cites":["HPQ.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPQ.d.ocf.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPQ.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPQ.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","HPQ.d.ocf.2025-11-01.2026-07-31","HPQ.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-10-31","HPQ.d.capex.2024-11-01.2025-07-31","HPQ.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-01-31","HPQ.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-04-30","HPQ.d.capex.2025-11-01.2026-07-31"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The proxy statement filed 2026-02-25 gives the principal executive officer’s total pay for FY2025 as $23.1 million in its summary compensation table, and the “compensation actually paid” - the SEC’s measure, which revalues share awards over the year - as $9.9 million.","cites":["HPQ.pay.peoTotal.2025","HPQ.pay.peoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"For the other named executive officers the same table gives an average of $7 million in total and $3.2 million actually paid.","cites":["HPQ.pay.neoTotal.2025","HPQ.pay.neoPaid.2025"]},{"topic":"pay","text":"The table puts the value of $100 held in the company’s shares over the years it covers at $181.93 at the end of FY2025, and $318.88 for the peer group the company chose.","cites":["HPQ.pay.tsr.2025","HPQ.pay.peerTsr.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Remaining performance obligations - revenue under contract that was not yet recognised - were $4.3 billion at the end of FY2025, against $3.9 billion a year earlier. That is 7.8% of FY2025 revenue (computed from two filed figures).","cites":["HPQ.rpo.2025","HPQ.rpo.2024","HPQ.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"backlog","text":"Deferred revenue was $3.2 billion at the end of FY2025 (tagged ContractWithCustomerLiability), against $2.9 billion a year earlier.","cites":["HPQ.deferred.2025","HPQ.deferred.2024"]},{"topic":"people","text":"The latest annual report gives the workforce as 55,000 in its own words. FY2025 revenue works out to about $1 million for each (computed from one filed figure and the number in that sentence).","cites":["HPQ.q.employees","HPQ.revenue.2025"]},{"topic":"flags","text":"The FY2025 annual report tags restructuring charges of $327 million, after $233 million in FY2024.","cites":["HPQ.restructuring.2025","HPQ.restructuring.2024"]},{"topic":"debt","text":"At the end of FY2025 the balance sheet carried $3.7 billion in cash and cash equivalents, and $9.7 billion of debt as tagged (LongTermDebtNoncurrent + DebtCurrent). Debt less cash was $6 billion (computed from three filed figures).","cites":["HPQ.cash.2025","HPQ.debtLong.2025","HPQ.debtCurrent.2025"]}]},"fin":{"HPQ":{"insiders":{"from":"2025-11-23","to":"2026-11-23","complete":true,"listed":51,"read":51,"other":0,"failed":0,"odd":0,"people":[["Olson Anneliese","Pres Imaging Prtng & Solutions"],["McQuarrie David P.","Chief Commercial Officer"],["Citrino Mary Anne","Director"],["Patel Ketan M","President, Personal Systems"],["LORES ENRIQUE","President and CEO, director"]],"rows":[["S",0,18997,618542.32,"2026-10-29","2026-10-29","0002043764-26-000008","2026-10-29",0],["S",1,31572,1014092.64,"2026-10-02","2026-10-02","0001951912-26-000008","2026-10-06",1],["S",1,21048,631019.04,"2026-08-07","